@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Menampilkan Rekomendasi Produk (Cross-sell)
autonumber

actor Marketing
boundary "View: Form Penawaran\n(Vue Component)" as View
control "AnalyticsController" as Controller
participant "RecommendationService" as Service
entity "AprioriRule (Model)" as Model
database "Database" as DB

Marketing -> View: Menambahkan "Produk A" ke daftar item
note right: User berinteraksi di browser

loop Setiap 800ms (Polling)
    View -> View: collectProductIds()
    note right: Cek apakah ada perubahan item

    opt Jika ada perubahan item
        View -> Controller: GET /admin/analytics/recommendations\n(params: product_ids=[A])

        activate Controller
            Controller -> Service: getRecommendations(productIds=[A])

            activate Service
                Service -> Model: findRulesByAntecedents(productIds)
                activate Model
                    Model -> DB: SELECT * FROM apriori_rules\nWHERE lhs IN ([A])
                    DB --> Model: Return Rules (A => B, A => C)
                Model --> Service: Return Rules Collection
                deactivate Model

                Service -> Service: formatRecommendations(rules)
            Service --> Controller: Return JSON Data
            deactivate Service

            Controller --> View: JSON Response\n{ data: [Produk B, Produk C] }
        deactivate Controller

        View -> View: Update Widget Rekomendasi
    end
end

View --> Marketing: Tampilkan "Produk B" dan "Produk C"

Marketing -> View: Klik "Add" pada Produk B
View -> View: Tambahkan Produk B ke Daftar Item
note right: Produk B masuk ke daftar,\nPolling berikutnya akan mengirim [A, B]

@enduml
